4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3_n1P6mtqZ0Q7kNvwHdNysa&_nc_oc=AdpayQufg9U3fmuzsSZIfdIKMePnIM_KxWUrlYgkF_LTQPnluqClKNxqtkjlEyXWvL8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLrTUsdPAnXp8BnUBNK2awV_Ms5WfwH-F_rlAkn6_ga8Q&oe=6AB3CE54"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=s2kCXst_xTEQ7kNvwHDRkbU&_nc_oc=AdrxvGTHxfXKgmBGsUfiFwGFtRmaN_V8GxU9dZPKRoCatdycK3XVwD-hg-G45zuu2bQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKtoyqynKHDp4rt09TEoz5lOoH3MMbEYR70WBuAtdHjfQ&oe=6AB3D332"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2lkclVvLGOIQ7kNvwGhqnKe&_nc_oc=Adr7-Df0lxRtiMqbQ2-lB74gG0jVvzwLKYa9rAFALsYIYoA4WxKwO1Jtfwx3kooVLnE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK7F_JOf5rt_MblXFQS7onv_jogG-ot8iD-7P3vga2XYw&oe=6AB3E0D5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p